'''Magma Glare''' is a [[Magma Cube]] type [[Mob]] that spawns when fighting {{MobSprite|Magma Boss}}.

== Spawning ==
After each phase of {{MobSprite|Magma Boss}}, it hides and spawns [[Unstable Magma]]s and '''Magma Glares'''. After each phase, 2 {{confirm}} '''Magma Glares''' spawn targeting each player that has attacked the boss. On top of that, up to 5 additional '''Magma Glares''' will spawn, depending on the {{stat|dmg}} dealt by the player.{{Confirm}}

