== Behavior ==
After spawned '''Magma Glares''' slowly bounce towards their respective players, attacking them with ranged attacks. They deal {{stat|dmg|2000}} per hit, which is increases based on the number of '''Magma Glares''' targeting the hit player via the following formula {{code|(2*n)*1000}} where {{code|n}} is the number of Magma Glares. Their damage bonus and the amount of Magma Glares targeting the player is shown in their action bar.

After enough of them are killed, both [[Unstable Magma]]s and '''Magma Glares''' drift towards the center of arena and {{MobSprite|Magma Boss}} is once again spawned.

